<http://data.silknow.org/event/cb1cec05-034a-3bb8-a11a-0c03b8602b44>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Transferred from India Museum 1879.\nThese trousers were collected in Udaipur as part of a man's costume, of which the other constituents were a white muslin robe, a red cotton scarf and a red cotton turban.  The price for the whole ensemble was 84 rupees, 12 annas, and 3 paisa.  Although worn in Rajasthan, the mashru material of these trousers  is typical of Varanesi. Slip book entry 6292: 'Suit of men's clothes / Oodeypore / 1867 / Original nos. 4319 / consists of 4 pieces (5) / Price Rs.84-12-3 / Scarf Taken out'. 1880 Register Entry: '05650. PYJAMAS. Amber satin. Dress, white muslin. Scarf, crimson cotton, with gold lace border. Turban, crimson cotton gauze, with gold lace border; Oodypore. 6292.'"@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/1e43996b-5c99-331b-8a34-12a8ffc227a1> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Transferred from India Museum 1879.\nThese trousers were collected in Udaipur as part of a man's costume, of which the other constituents were a white muslin robe, a red cotton scarf and a red cotton turban.  The price for the whole ensemble was 84 rupees, 12 annas, and 3 paisa.  Although worn in Rajasthan, the mashru material of these trousers  is typical of Varanesi. Slip book entry 6292: 'Suit of men's clothes / Oodeypore / 1867 / Original nos. 4319 / consists of 4 pieces (5) / Price Rs.84-12-3 / Scarf Taken out'. 1880 Register Entry: '05650. PYJAMAS. Amber satin. Dress, white muslin. Scarf, crimson cotton, with gold lace border. Turban, crimson cotton gauze, with gold lace border; Oodypore. 6292.'"@en .
